OL,3,AOasis will not headline Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027, organiser Emily Eavis confirms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis led some fans to conclude the
OL,7,FGallaghers may have been planning to
OL,8,Frock up at Worthy Farm's Pyramid Stage
OL,9,Fto close the event. But Eavis has put
OL,10,Fthose rumours to bed in a direct
OL,11,Fresponse to one Glastonbury-goer on
OL,12,Fsocial media.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
